libfyaml
------------------------------------------
A fancy 1.2 YAML and JSON parser/writer.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.10-1
  cygwin-devel-3.6.10-1
  libfyaml-devel-0.9.6-1bl1
  libfyaml0-0.9.6-1bl1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libxxhash0-0.8.3-1
  pkg-config-3.0.5-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  check-0.15.2-1
  cmake-4.2.1-1
  cygport-0.37.7-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libxxhash-devel-0.8.3-1
  libyaml-devel-0.2.5-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/pantoniou/libfyaml

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/pantoniou/libfyaml/archive/refs/tags/v0.9.6.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libfyaml-0.9.6-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libfyaml-0.9.6-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libfyaml-0.9.6-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfyaml-0.9.6-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfyaml0-0.9.6-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfyaml-devel-0.9.6-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

